{
 "artist": {
  "bio": "I am an abstract painter and teacher living in County Wicklow, Ireland.\n\nMy work is a celebration of the energy of life.\n\nThe vitality, movement, colour, rhythm and interconnectedness that exist within the natural world and within human experience.\n\nI am inspired by the many ways different cultures express this life force through their textiles, customs, rituals, patterns, adornment and surroundings. These expressions reveal a shared human desire to celebrate existence, honour place and communicate a sense of belonging and connection. It is this vitality that I seek to engage within my own practice. I respond through a felt sense of place rather than seeking an exact depiction of what I see. Paint, printed patterns and drawn imagery become ways of building surfaces. Layer upon layer, marks and forms accumulate, echoing lived experience.",
